{
  "core": "5.5.4",
  "scope": "existing-document preservation, page mutations and external CMS signing; remaining Rust API pending audit; composed extraction policies; incremental free-text editing; incremental Ink editing; configurable partitioning, element graphs, custom token counting and document export; real page iteration with explicit parser lifetime; lossless incremental event bridge (upstream parser limitations remain); all BatchOptions fields with observable executor limitations; structured SignatureError exceptions; bounded existing-document outline reading; parser and recovery configuration with explicit upstream consumption limits; bounded semantic comparison with physical revision attribution (core object-stream layout limitation documented); validated packed image pixel constructors and owned image/alpha inspection; affine transform matrices and coordinate conversions (Page stores the system without automatic content transformation); mutable RenderContext with independent stored matrix and live coordinate conversions; Page unrotated content bounds and effective rotated dimensions; clipping path construction, owned command inspection and winding rules (intersection/text clipping/region stack excluded); line dash factories, owned parameters and core serialization; all 16 blend modes and their PDF names; effective streaming and lazy-document options with requested/effective/unsupported configurations and adapter-scoped cache budgets; Color conversions and space inspection; incremental tagged structure editor with preparation and sequential mutations; incremental TextNote and Highlight editors with typed identities, geometry, RGB/opacity and native DocMDP policy",
